<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβίαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιάζομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unforced, without force</i> or <i>violence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				61a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. φυλάξει</span>”
				<i>shall maintain order,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PThead.
					19.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unstrained, unaffected,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not liable to compulsion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ ἀπαθεί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				5.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>irresistible,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MA</u>
					703a22
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Epict.</u>
				p.117D.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
